        "official_en_sha256": "0ec94927046a468075e8d2de4824571d11c49b19e5185d44b61ecc47333223a4"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この国が積み上げてきた歴史と民の品格は、\r\nこんなことでは揺らがんよ。",
        "official_en": "It’ll take more than this to strip away all the history and dignity the people of this country have built up.",
