      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この配給、城のコックが作っているらしいね。",
        "official_en": "I heard the food given out here’s made by the royal chefs. Explains why the soup’s so darn good.",
        "real_en": "I hear the castle's cooks make the food they're handing out here."
