      "text": {
        "jp": "って、レイン隊長！\r\n本官は商業区の見回り任務中であります！",
        "official_en": "Ack! Commander Rain!? I-I was just...uh...patrolling and...guarding the barstool...sir.",
        "real_en": "C-Commander Rain! I'm on patrol in the commercial district, sir!"
