      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "なんでも、戦の準備をしてるって\r\n噂で聞いたぜ。\r\n皇帝がかなり暴君なんだとさ。",
        "official_en": "Some even say they’re preparing for war. Word has it their emperor is evidently quite the tyrant.",
