      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レイン隊長、いつもお疲れ様。\r\nうちは早くに父が亡くなって、\r\n母とふたり暮らしだけど……。",
        "official_en": "Commander Rain, how nice of you to visit. My elderly mother and I... It’s just the two of us that live here now, since Father passed away...",
        "real_en": "Commander Rain, thank you for all your hard work. My father died when I was young, so it's just my mother and me..."
